{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#908","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#908","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#908\",\"parent_revision\":\"014613d05135a61ffe128e0862837b09323ef36b562de4918d8f5060345df5e1\",\"root_revision\":\"014613d05135a61ffe128e0862837b09323ef36b562de4918d8f5060345df5e1\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAfter writing a step to the job store, `vm_job_step` should POST a `step_added` event to the dashboard API event ingest endpoint. This is the primary push mechanism in the three-tier update strategy and required for real-time step log rendering in the dashboard.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **`vm_job_step` \u2014 post step_added event to dashboard api** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: PRD-vm-flightsimulator-v2\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-20\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"711966ef09feca7b1694f61cb5715918f8b116a98119e690711a9b0f487db383\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWY-7w\"}"}